    "detailed_description": "Try to survive in a dystopian future version of Europe that has been devastated by a global energy crisis. Embark on dangerous missions, gather essential resources, and expand your camp to rediscover your place in this broken world.<br><br><strong>Use cards to defeat enemies!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/68bc16cc38ecb3485d64f3eeb9060a53.poster.avif?t=1733388919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/68bc16cc38ecb3485d64f3eeb9060a53.webm?t=1733388919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/68bc16cc38ecb3485d64f3eeb9060a53.mp4?t=1733388919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Decide which cards you want to play. Different playstyles work against different enemies, so be careful what cards you choose!<br><br><strong>A vibrant variety of cards!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/c0068fca52047df1f5f8bf0f5c98cbd8.poster.avif?t=1733388919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/c0068fca52047df1f5f8bf0f5c98cbd8.webm?t=1733388919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/c0068fca52047df1f5f8bf0f5c98cbd8.mp4?t=1733388919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Deckbuilding is the heart of Kind Nature - each card opens up new opportunities. Collect a wide variety of attack, support or defense cards for your deck. Improve your character with powerful equipment cards and get stronger cards by collecting Runner Points with Runner cards.<br><br><strong>Develop your camp</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/dad46c5265791216a5f6f9d9e2f334eb.poster.avif?t=1733388919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/dad46c5265791216a5f6f9d9e2f334eb.webm?t=1733388919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/dad46c5265791216a5f6f9d9e2f334eb.mp4?t=1733388919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Research, craft and upgrade your cards in the survivor camp. Spend your resources to expand your camp with new buildings to unlock more cards. Upgrade buildings and increase your chances of surviving the next mission.<br><br><strong>Deckbuilding during battle!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/f793d568e04ab9106110b72ffb1f0295.poster.avif?t=1733388919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/f793d568e04ab9106110b72ffb1f0295.webm?t=1733388919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/f793d568e04ab9106110b72ffb1f0295.mp4?t=1733388919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use your animal companion to retrieve cards from a pre-selected, custom card pool. This adds another strategic level to combat as you balance offensive and defensive cards while building a stronger deck during your battles.<br><br><strong>Varied gameplay loop</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/0ded5c781a1c7b66f9dabea1dcdd04e8.poster.avif?t=1733388919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/0ded5c781a1c7b66f9dabea1dcdd04e8.webm?t=1733388919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/0ded5c781a1c7b66f9dabea1dcdd04e8.mp4?t=1733388919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Complete missions, battle enemies, and encounter various events. Progress by gathering resources, recruiting survivors, and befriending wildlife. Return to your camp and use the collected resources to upgrade buildings, recycle unwanted cards, and create new cards for your deck.",
    "about_the_game": "Try to survive in a dystopian future version of Europe that has been devastated by a global energy crisis. Embark on dangerous missions, gather essential resources, and expand your camp to rediscover your place in this broken world.<br><br><strong>Use cards to defeat enemies!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/68bc16cc38ecb3485d64f3eeb9060a53.poster.avif?t=1733388919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/68bc16cc38ecb3485d64f3eeb9060a53.webm?t=1733388919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/68bc16cc38ecb3485d64f3eeb9060a53.mp4?t=1733388919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Decide which cards you want to play. Different playstyles work against different enemies, so be careful what cards you choose!<br><br><strong>A vibrant variety of cards!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/c0068fca52047df1f5f8bf0f5c98cbd8.poster.avif?t=1733388919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/c0068fca52047df1f5f8bf0f5c98cbd8.webm?t=1733388919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/c0068fca52047df1f5f8bf0f5c98cbd8.mp4?t=1733388919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Deckbuilding is the heart of Kind Nature - each card opens up new opportunities. Collect a wide variety of attack, support or defense cards for your deck. Improve your character with powerful equipment cards and get stronger cards by collecting Runner Points with Runner cards.<br><br><strong>Develop your camp</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/dad46c5265791216a5f6f9d9e2f334eb.poster.avif?t=1733388919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/dad46c5265791216a5f6f9d9e2f334eb.webm?t=1733388919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/dad46c5265791216a5f6f9d9e2f334eb.mp4?t=1733388919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Research, craft and upgrade your cards in the survivor camp. Spend your resources to expand your camp with new buildings to unlock more cards. Upgrade buildings and increase your chances of surviving the next mission.<br><br><strong>Deckbuilding during battle!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/f793d568e04ab9106110b72ffb1f0295.poster.avif?t=1733388919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/f793d568e04ab9106110b72ffb1f0295.webm?t=1733388919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/f793d568e04ab9106110b72ffb1f0295.mp4?t=1733388919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use your animal companion to retrieve cards from a pre-selected, custom card pool. This adds another strategic level to combat as you balance offensive and defensive cards while building a stronger deck during your battles.<br><br><strong>Varied gameplay loop</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/0ded5c781a1c7b66f9dabea1dcdd04e8.poster.avif?t=1733388919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/0ded5c781a1c7b66f9dabea1dcdd04e8.webm?t=1733388919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407470/extras/0ded5c781a1c7b66f9dabea1dcdd04e8.mp4?t=1733388919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Complete missions, battle enemies, and encounter various events. Progress by gathering resources, recruiting survivors, and befriending wildlife. Return to your camp and use the collected resources to upgrade buildings, recycle unwanted cards, and create new cards for your deck.",
